      "source": "Invoke <a href=\"../../TestContextManager.html#prepareTestInstance(java.lang.Object)\"><code>TestContextManager.prepareTestInstance(Object)</code></a> and\nthen evaluate the next <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://junit.org/junit4/javadoc/4.13.2/org/junit/runners/model/Statement.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.runners.model\"><code>Statement</code></a> in the execution chain\n(typically an instance of <a href=\"RunAfterTestMethodCallbacks.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.junit4.statements\"><code>RunAfterTestMethodCallbacks</code></a>).",
      "translation": "调用<a href=\"../../TestContextManager.html#prepareTestInstance(java.lang.Object)\"><code>TestContextManager.prepareTestInstance(Object)</code></a>，然后评估执行链中的下一个<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://junit.org/junit4/javadoc/4.13.2/org/junit/runners/model/Statement.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.runners.model\"><code>Statement</code></a>（通常是<a href=\"RunAfterTestMethodCallbacks.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.junit4.statements\"><code>RunAfterTestMethodCallbacks</code></a>的实例）。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>RunPrepareTestInstanceCallbacks</code> is a custom JUnit <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://junit.org/junit4/javadoc/4.13.2/org/junit/runners/model/Statement.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.runners.model\"><code>Statement</code></a> which\nallows the <em>Spring TestContext Framework</em> to be plugged into the JUnit\nexecution chain by calling <a href=\"../../TestContextManager.html#prepareTestInstance(java.lang.Object)\"><code>prepareTestInstance()</code></a> on the supplied <a href=\"../../TestContextManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>TestContextManager</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<code>RunPrepareTestInstanceCallbacks</code> 是一个自定义的 JUnit <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://junit.org/junit4/javadoc/4.13.2/org/junit/runners/model/Statement.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.runners.model\"><code>Statement</code></a>，它通过调用提供的 <a href=\"../../TestContextManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>TestContextManager</code></a> 上的 <a href=\"../../TestContextManager.html#prepareTestInstance(java.lang.Object)\"><code>prepareTestInstance()</code></a> 方法，允许将 <em>Spring TestContext Framework</em> 集成到 JUnit 执行链中。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Construct a new <code>RunPrepareTestInstanceCallbacks</code> statement.",
      "translation": "构建一个新的<code>RunPrepareTestInstanceCallbacks</code>语句。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>testContextManager</code> - the <code>TestContextManager</code> upon which to call\n<code>prepareTestInstance()</code>; never <code>null</code>",
      "translation": "<code>testContextManager</code> - 在其上调用 <code>prepareTestInstance()</code> 的 <code>TestContextManager</code>；绝不 <code>null</code>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>next</code> - the next <code>Statement</code> in the execution chain; never <code>null</code>",
      "translation": "<code>next</code> - 执行链中的下一个 <code>Statement</code>；永远不会为 <code>null</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
